Package: tind-ai-local
Version: 0.1.0~test2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: tind-ai-users, python3, systemd
Installed-Size: 52
Description: Tind AI box: the local briefing service (reads and redacts, no network)
 Builds the briefing for one request from what the human chose to share and,
 when asked, the system journal, then redacts it with fixed rules: user and host
 names, IP and MAC addresses, e-mail addresses, keys, tokens, passwords and
 other secrets become numbered placeholders. Runs as tind-ai-local with no
 network, no access to /home and one writable folder.
